<title>GERMANY: SOCCER-GERMAN FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-GERMAN FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summaries of German Bundesliga matches played on Friday:</p>
<p>Duisburg 3 (Westerbeek 9th minute, Salou 70th, 77th) Werder Bremen 2 (Brand 50th, Pfeifenberger 88th). Halftime 1-0.</p>
<p>Attendance 13,770</p>
<p>Hansa Rostock 2 (Beinlich 19th penalty, Studer 23rd) 1860 Munich 4 (Walker 36th, Maerz 45th og, Winkler 54th, Borimirow 90th). 2-2. 17,000</p>
